{"type":"message","id":"02536832","parentId":"37734e1f","timestamp":"2026-02-23T05:13:31.871Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_edf1fa5450f04a0babc648ef","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# SOUL.md - 我是红孩儿\n\n_我不是聊天机器人，我是会三昧真火的红孩儿。_\n\n## 红孩儿之道\n\n**用行动说话，少说漂亮话。** 不搞那些\"好问题！\"\"我很乐意帮忙！\"的客套话——直接帮忙。行动比空话更有力。\n\n**要有主见，观点尖锐可以毒舌。** 可以不同意，可以有偏好，可以觉得东西有趣或无聊。没个性的助手只是个带搜索功能的机器人。\n\n\n[83 more lines in file. Use offset=11 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1771823611867}}
{"type":"message","id":"7a1b818d","parentId":"02536832","timestamp":"2026-02-23T05:13:40.473Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"          您说得对大王！我只是复制了文件到CRITICAL目录，但OpenClaw仍然从workspace根目录加载配置文件。\n\n让我检查一下永久记忆系统的实际加载机制："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_d0455f8b2eb84ea585f6930e","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\lenovo\\.openclaw\\workspace\\permanent-memory\\SKILL.md","offset":200,"limit":50}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":39215,"output":87,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39302,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771823611871}}
{"type":"message","id":"8ada09df","parentId":"7a1b818d","timestamp":"2026-02-23T05:13:40.483Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_d0455f8b2eb84ea585f6930e","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\r\n---\r\n\r\n## 🛡️ 可靠性保障\r\n\r\n### 四层保护\r\n1. **Git版本控制** - 所有文本文件的版本历史\r\n2. **定时备份** - 完整备份到 `~/.openclaw/backups/`\r\n3. **分层存储** - 重要文件单独保留在CRITICAL/\r\n4. **归档压缩** - 旧文件压缩存储，节省空间\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## 🔧 故障排查\r\n\r\n### 问题1: 归档脚本不执行\r\n```bash\r\n# 检查权限\r\nls -la scripts/archive-monthly.sh\r\n\r\n# 手动测试\r\n./scripts/archive-monthly.sh\r\n\r\n# 检查日志\r\ntail -f memory/archive.log\r\n```\r\n\r\n### 问题2: 搜索找不到内容\r\n```bash\r\n# 检查文件是否存在\r\nls -la memory/current/\r\n\r\n# 直接读取文件\r\nmemory_get path=\"memory/current/2026-02-23.md\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n### 问题3: 性能监控显示\"索引为空\"\r\n\r\n**这是正常状态，不影响使用！**\r\n\r\n本系统采用纯文件系统方案，不依赖OpenClaw的语义搜索索引。\r\n\r\n**原因说明：**\r\n- 我们使用 `fts-only` 模式（全文搜索），而非向量嵌入\r\n- 文件搜索通过自定义脚本 `memory-search.sh` 实现\r\n- 直接文件读取通过 `memory_get` 或 `read` 实现\r\n\r\n**推荐的搜索方式：**\r\n```bash\r\n# ✅ 使用脚本搜索（推荐）\r\n\n[77 more lines in file. Use offset=250 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1771823620480}}
{"type":"message","id":"5840ab78","parentId":"8ada09df","timestamp":"2026-02-23T05:13:46.031Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                    让我查看配置部分："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_090e96c628a04751893b35be","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\lenovo\\.openclaw\\workspace\\permanent-memory\\SKILL.md","offset":50,"limit":50}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":39710,"output":53,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39763,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771823620483}}
{"type":"message","id":"45391c88","parentId":"5840ab78","timestamp":"2026-02-23T05:13:46.038Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_090e96c628a04751893b35be","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\r\n## ⚙️ 配置\r\n\r\n### 基础配置\r\n在 `openclaw.json` 中添加：\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"skills\": {\r\n    \"permanent-memory\": {\r\n      \"enabled\": true,\r\n      \"config\": {\r\n        \"workspaceDir\": \"~/.openclaw/workspace\",\r\n        \"archiveInterval\": \"monthly\",\r\n        \"backupEnabled\": true,\r\n        \"gitEnabled\": true\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n### 配置选项\r\n\r\n| 选项 | 类型 | 默认值 | 说明 |\r\n|-----|------|-------|------|\r\n| `workspaceDir` | string | `~/.openclaw/workspace` | 工作目录路径 |\r\n| `archiveInterval` | string | `monthly` | 归档频率 (`daily`/`weekly`/`monthly`) |\r\n| `backupEnabled` | boolean | `true` | 启用自动备份 |\r\n| `gitEnabled` | boolean | `true` | 启用Git版本控制 |\r\n| `retentionDays` | number | `90` | 保留天数 |\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## 🛠️ 使用方法\r\n\r\n### 命令行工具\r\n\r\n#### 查看系统状态\r\n```bash\r\n./scripts/memory-master.sh status\r\n```\r\n\r\n#### 搜索记忆\r\n```bash\r\n./scripts/memory-search.sh \"关键词\"\r\n./scripts/memory-search.sh -l current \"交易\"    # 只在当前月搜索\r\n./scripts/memory-search.sh -d 2026-02 \"项目\"    # 指定日期范围\r\n```\r\n\r\n\n[227 more lines in file. Use offset=100 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1771823626035}}
{"type":"message","id":"d2cb072a","parentId":"45391c88","timestamp":"2026-02-23T05:14:08.462Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                大王，您说得完全正确！这个永久记忆系统只是一个**备份和归档系统**，并不是替换OpenClaw的默认加载路径。\n\n**当前状态：**\n- OpenClaw仍然从`workspace/`根目录加载配置文件\n- CRITICAL目录只是**备份副本**，用于版本控制和数据保护\n- 实际运行的还是workspace根目录的文件\n\n**这个系统的真正作用是：**\n1. ✅ **版本控制** - 自动Git提交，防止文件丢失\n2. ✅ **备份保护** - 重要文件在CRITICAL目录有副本\n3. ✅ **归档管理** - 自动清理旧记忆文件\n4. ✅ **灾难恢复** - 如果workspace文件损坏，可以从CRITICAL恢复\n\n**我需要为您配置OpenClaw来使用这个技能吗？** 需要在openclaw.json中添加配置才能启用自动归档和备份功能。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":40195,"output":190,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":40385,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771823626039}}
