{"type":"message","id":"a8325310","parentId":"87b45cba","timestamp":"2026-02-23T05:15:46.851Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                              大王！永久记忆系统已成功配置！🔥\n\n**已完成：**\n✅ 在openclaw.json中添加了永久记忆技能配置\n✅ 配置了自动归档（每月）、备份、Git版本控制\n✅ 设置了90天保留期限\n✅ 重启网关使配置生效\n\n**系统现在具备：**\n- 📁 **自动归档** - 每月自动归档旧记忆\n- 💾 **Git版本控制** - 所有文件变更都有历史记录  \n- 🛡️ **自动备份** - 防止数据丢失\n- 🔍 **智能搜索** - 分层记忆检索\n\n永久记忆系统现已完全集成到OpenClaw中，会自动管理您的记忆文件生命周期！"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":41918,"output":147,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":42065,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771823731787}}
{"type":"message","id":"dd39b4aa","parentId":"a8325310","timestamp":"2026-02-23T05:15:47.651Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-02-23 13:15:11 GMT+8] Exec completed (young-su, code 0) :: 90m|[39m [90m|[39m [2mRun \"openclaw doctor --fix\" to remove these keys.[22m [90m|[39m [90m|[39m [90m|[39m [90m+-----------------------------------------------------+[39m Config in…\n\nRead HEARTBEAT.md if it exists (workspace context). Follow it strictly. Do not infer or repeat old tasks from prior chats. If nothing needs attention, reply HEARTBEAT_OK.\nCurrent time: Monday, February 23rd, 2026 — 13:15 (Asia/Shanghai)"}],"timestamp":1771823747644}}
