{"type":"message","id":"0527799f","parentId":"a458cf40","timestamp":"2026-02-23T06:18:34.091Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"大王！已完成以下配置：🔥\n\n**✅ 定时任务配置完成：**\n1. 每日18:00文档清理\n2. 每日01:00 Han酱AI简报  \n3. 每日23:00任务回顾\n\n**📝 ParseHub注册指南已创建：**\n- 详细步骤：注册 → 创建项目 → 设置定时\n- 平台配置：淘宝 + 亚马逊监控\n- 数据导出：Google Sheets自动集成\n\n**🎯 立即行动建议：**\n1. 访问 https://www.parsehub.com/signup\n2. 使用Google账号快速注册\n3. 创建\\\"ESP32语音\\\"监控项目\n4. 设置8小时自动运行\n\n**⏰ 预计耗时：** 30分钟即可完成注册和基础配置！\n\n需要我继续协助其他配置吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":57759,"output":178,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":57937,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771827490648}}
