{"type":"message","id":"b0100c38","parentId":"92d49a02","timestamp":"2026-02-23T06:20:15.115Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"      大王！**紧急安全提醒** 🔴\n\n您的密码已在聊天中暴露！请立即：\n\n**第一步：立即修改ParseHub密码**\n1. 访问 https://www.parsehub.com/login\n2. 登录后 → Settings → Security → Change Password\n3. 设置强密码（建议：Cent@ry2026!ParseHub）\n\n**第二步：启用二次验证**\n1. Settings → Security → 2FA\n2. 使用验证器App扫描二维码\n\n**第三步：检查登录历史**\n确认没有异常登录记录\n\n**安全指南已保存**到工作报告目录，包含详细的安全配置步骤。\n\n密码安全第一！修改完成后告诉我，我再帮您配置监控项目。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":59361,"output":146,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":59507,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771827590694}}
