{"type":"message","id":"dd51d7dc","parentId":"a994074d","timestamp":"2026-02-23T06:58:54.291Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                    大王！ParseHub桌面版已经启动成功。让我帮您控制它完成ESP32项目配置。\n\n**ParseHub桌面版使用流程：**\n\n1. **手动操作部分（需要您操作）：**\n   - 点击ParseHub图标启动软件\n   - 使用您的账号登录\n   - 点击\"New Project\"\n\n2. **我指导的部分：**\n   - 提供目标网址\n   - 指导数据采集配置\n   - 帮助设置抓取规则\n\n**请先：**\n1. 确保ParseHub桌面版已打开\n2. 登录您的账号 (909599954@qq.com)\n3. 点击\"New Project\"按钮\n\n**然后告诉我：**\n- 是否看到项目创建界面？\n- 是否需要输入目标网址？\n\n**目标网址准备：**\n- 淘宝：`https://s.taobao.com/search?q=ESP32语音`\n- 亚马逊：`https://www.amazon.com/s?k=ESP32+Voice`\n\n我现在随时准备指导您完成每一步配置！"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":62766,"output":218,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":62984,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771829910867}}
